!/docs/building.md
!/docs/RG-NHL-001.md
!/docs/RG-NHL-002.md
!/Legacy Edition/
/Legacy Edition/*
!/Legacy Edition/README.md
!/Legacy Edition/nhllegacy.toml
!/assets/
/assets/*
!/assets/icons/
